{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56503","headline":"还丹歌 · 岑真人","name":"还丹歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东方青龙，丙丁甲乙。\n西方白虎，壬癸凝液。\n二气舍真，世人难觅。\n机持此宝，一水一石。\n灰池焰烁，名除死籍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑真人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56503.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56503","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}